{"id":"yasnost_","lemma":"ясность","pos":"noun","rank":4992,"glosses":["clarity, lucidity"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7f/Ru-%D1%8F%D1%81%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D1%8F%D1%81%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"ясности"},"examples":[{"text":"Люди ценят ясность.","en":"People appreciate clarity.","words":[{"g":"people, humans"},{"g":"to appreciate","l":"ценить"},null]},{"text":"Я просто хочу внести ясность.","en":"I just want to be clear.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"simply, plainly, just"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to carry in"},null]},{"text":"Позвольте мне внести ясность.","en":"Let me clarify that.","words":[{"g":"to allow, to permit","l":"позволить"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"to carry in"},null]},{"text":"Постарайтесь сохранять ясность мыслей.","en":"Try to keep a clear head.","words":[{"g":"to try, to attempt","l":"постараться"},{"g":"to save"},null,{"g":"thought","l":"мысль"}]},{"text":"Смерть - это зачастую то, разговоры или даже мысли о чем приводят в уныние, но я осознал, что готовность умереть наделяет силой, как ничто другое. Мысль о смерти вносит ясность в твою жизнь.","en":"Death is something that we're often discouraged to talk about or even think about, but I've realized that preparing for death is one of the most empowering things you can do. Thinking about death clarifies your life.","words":[{"g":"death"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"often"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"talk, conversation","l":"разговор"},{"g":"or"},{"g":"even"},{"g":"thought","l":"мысль"},{"g":"about"},{"g":"than"},{"g":"to bring","l":"приводить"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"gloom"},{"g":"but"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to recognize","l":"осознать"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"preparedness"},{"g":"to die of natural causes"},null,null,{"g":"how / like"},{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"other","l":"другой"},{"g":"thought"},{"g":"about"},{"g":"death","l":"смерть"},null,null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"your","l":"твой"},{"g":"life"}]}]}